{"articleNo":"117214","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=117214&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"(원룸지역) 불법쓰레기투기행위 집중 단속 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.11.11","hit":"2653","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">원룸지역&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">생활쓰레기 불법투기행위에 대한 집중 단속 사실을 다음과 같이 안내하오니</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">주변 거주자(학생)는 반드시 종량제봉투에 담아서 배출하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">또한, 불법투기행위로 적발되면 폐기물관리법 제</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">8</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">조에 의거 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">100</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">만원이하의 과태료가</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">부과됨을 </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">알려드립니다.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">원룸지역 단속반 운영 : 구미시 양포동 주민센터)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 생활쓰레기 배출방법</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;<span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">□</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일반쓰레기는 종량제봉투에 담아서 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">19:00~24:00</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">에 배출</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">종량제봉투는 인근 슈퍼마켓이나 상점에서 판매)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">&nbsp;□ </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">음식물쓰레기는 음식물 전용 종량제 봉투 및 용기에 담아 배출</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">&nbsp;□ </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">가구</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">소파</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">냉장고 등은 대형폐기물처리 납부스티커 부착 후 배출</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">&nbsp;□ </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">PET, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">병</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">캔</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">비닐</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">필름류</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">), </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">종이 등 재활용품은 분리 배출</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><font face=\"함초롬바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (</font>분리 배출하지 않을 경우 일반생활쓰레기종량제봉투에 담아 배출)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">&nbsp;□ </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">모든 쓰레기는 내 집앞</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">상가 앞</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">에 배출</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
